  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As an African research institution, Population Council-Kenya (PC-Kenya) generates locally produced knowledge and evidence to expand sexual and reproductive health and choice throughout East Africa. Over the next few years, PC-Kenya aims to strengthen its governance structures, expand impactful partnerships with young feminist organizations and other marginalized regional stakeholders, and improve its strategic communications and DEI policies and procedures. This core support grant will enable PC-Kenya to deepen these focal areas. (Strategy: Global Reproductive Equity)</narrative>
  </description>
